RC native regression, cases 1-5. iPhone 18 Pro Simulator, iOS 27.0 (24A434), Xcode 27.0 (27A266a).
App: sa.haratna.app.socialdev Debug, built from rc/integration 6114d07 (dev overlay: bundle ID, name, scheme,
Apple Sign-In off; Metro port 8082). Backend: local synthetic Supabase via loopback fault proxy 127.0.0.1:55430.
Accounts: synthetic fixture rc4c4578 (a, b @example.invalid). App language: Arabic.
Proxy lines: method/path/status only. "COMMITTED 200" = the server committed before the response was held/dropped.
The 400 publish_post lines are the one-time capability probe (null op id; always rejected, writes nothing).

== Case 1: post committed, response lost (test1_LostPostResponse) -- PASS
