Harness incidents (not counted as results):
- First case-1 runs loaded Codex's older dev bundle from Metro 8081 on the other Simulator (no RC
  proxy traffic; the stray post had no client_op_id). That synthetic row was soft-deleted. All counted
  runs used the fresh device and the 8082 build, with a per-test assertion of RC proxy traffic.
- One case-1 run dropped only the probe's 400 (nothing committed); the proxy was then restricted to
  dropping/holding 2xx responses only.
